  "plain": "In 1989 Bob Lazar, a man who says he worked on alien craft at S4, a secret site near Groom Lake in Nevada, says he took people out into the desert to watch test flights, and on the last trip they were caught and he was banned from S4. Lazar tells Michels that on the earlier trip \"they didn't know we were out there,\" so the last one was where it went wrong. In his telling this is how his time at the site ended."
